<view class="page">
  <scroll-view scroll-y class="scroll">
    <view class="header">
      <view class="logo">🍅</view>
      <view class="app-name">番茄专注</view>
      <view class="subtitle">{{busy ? '正在登录…' : '微信登录后开始你的专注'}}</view>
    </view>

    <block wx:if="{{!blocked}}">
      <view class="card">
        <button
          class="wx-btn {{agree ? '' : 'wx-btn-dim'}}"
          bindtap="doLogin"
          loading="{{busy}}"
          disabled="{{busy}}"
        >
          <text class="wx-icon">微</text>
          <text class="wx-text">{{busy ? '登录中…' : '微信一键登录'}}</text>
        </button>

        <view class="err" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view>

        <view class="agree-row">
          <view class="agree-line" bindtap="toggleAgree">
            <view class="box {{agree ? 'box-on' : ''}}">
              <text class="tick" wx:if="{{agree}}">✓</text>
            </view>
            <text class="agree-text">我已阅读并同意</text>
          </view>
          <text class="link" catchtap="openPolicy">《隐私政策》</text>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="footer">
        微信登录仅用于识别身份，专注计划与记录仍保存在本机，不上传服务器
        <view class="api-line" bindtap="editApiBase">服务器：{{apiBase}}</view>
      </view>
    </block>

    <block wx:else>
      <view class="card blocked-card">
        <view class="blocked-title">未同意隐私政策</view>
        <view class="blocked-text">
          同意《隐私政策》后才能使用番茄专注管理。我们不会在你同意之前收集任何信息，
          也不会发起微信登录或申请摄像头等权限。
        </view>
        <button class="btn btn-outline mt16" bindtap="reopenPrivacy">重新阅读隐私政策</button>
      </view>
    </block>
  </scroll-view>

  <privacy-dialog
    show="{{showPrivacy}}"
    bind:agree="onPrivacyAgree"
    bind:disagree="onPrivacyDisagree"
    bind:detail="onPrivacyDetail"
  />

  <confirm-dialog
    show="{{showAgreeConfirm}}"
    title="隐私政策"
    content="你还没有勾选《隐私政策》。&#10;&#10;继续操作即表示你已阅读并同意本政策，同意后我们会为你自动勾选。"
    cancelText="取消"
    confirmText="同意并继续"
    bind:cancel="onAgreeCancel"
    bind:confirm="onAgreeConfirm"
  />
</view>
